<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico completes credit auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico completes credit auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Banco de Mexico completed three credit auctions on the secondary market on Friday.</p>
<p>AUCTIONS    TERM   AVERAGE MAXIMUM  MINIMUM     BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.305 bln  14 days  28.00   26.93    27.25	 6	   4</p>
<p>1.306 bln  12 days  26.83   26.83    26.83	 1	   1</p>
<p>1.000 bln   3 day   25.85   25.38    25.57	 2	   2</p>
<p>The minimum, maximum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 728-9559</p>
</text>
